sequenceDiagram
    %% SD5 - Deliver an order to the customer's home
    %% Stories: 46, 47, 48, 49, 50
    %% Description: The home delivery person gets the delivery address early and a ticket with address, price and phone number. The owner records the cash received by delivery people.
    actor HD as Home delivery person
    actor OW as Restaurant owner
    participant OD as Order
    participant DP as DeliveryPerson
    participant CA as Cash

    %% covers 48
    HD->>OD: get delivery address early
    %% covers 47, 49, 50
    HD->>OD: get delivery ticket
    OD->>DP: delivery person
    %% covers 46
    OW->>DP: record cash received per day
    DP->>CA: cash received
    DP->>OD: delivered orders
